{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Sugar Squad Rumble",
    "steam_appid": 3758490,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758490/extras/71af5610c39e99321cbf416837a2fada.poster.avif?t=1748619576\" width=281 height=263 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758490/extras/71af5610c39e99321cbf416837a2fada.webm?t=1748619576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sugar Squad Rumble is a fun, easy to play roguelike turn-based RPG in a food focused game world that offers lots of depth for those that want to go down the radish hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reclaim Your Rightful Place in Stardom</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of Sugar Squad, a rogue-like RPG where every battle is a burst of flavor! Command an unstoppable team of sugary sweets as you wage war against rival food factions in a food filled New York City. Strategize and upgrade your sweet heroes, and dive into exciting battles to reclaim your stardom and serve up some seriously sweet justice. Join the Sugar Squad and taste victory like never before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sugar Rush System \u2013 raise your sugar levels as you battle opponents and charge up your team to unleash massive damage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute hand-drawn kawaii art style with big eyes that hypnotize you with their cuteness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat pits you against pitted fruit and other monstrosities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laughs around every corner.\u00a0 Hilarious dialog throughout the story, and characters taunt each other during battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-class system with upgradable abilities to increase your team\u2019s effectiveness.\u00a0 Try different combinations to best suit your play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rest and recover your teammates, no perma-death!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore New York City via the procedural subway map for infinite replay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet all sorts of various critters.\u00a0 We mean rats.\u00a0 Lots of rats.\u00a0 Pizza rat, taco rat, etc.\u00a0 Subway is filled with them.\u00a0 And they help you on your quest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock various dance moves for your to use in your victory celebrations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect stickers, trinkets and snacks to help you in your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758490/extras/b8e6788a63e36696044b931a03da27a4.poster.avif?t=1748619576\" width=328 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758490/extras/b8e6788a63e36696044b931a03da27a4.webm?t=1748619576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758490/extras/71af5610c39e99321cbf416837a2fada.poster.avif?t=1748619576\" width=281 height=263 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758490/extras/71af5610c39e99321cbf416837a2fada.webm?t=1748619576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sugar Squad Rumble is a fun, easy to play roguelike turn-based RPG in a food focused game world that offers lots of depth for those that want to go down the radish hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reclaim Your Rightful Place in Stardom</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of Sugar Squad, a rogue-like RPG where every battle is a burst of flavor! Command an unstoppable team of sugary sweets as you wage war against rival food factions in a food filled New York City. Strategize and upgrade your sweet heroes, and dive into exciting battles to reclaim your stardom and serve up some seriously sweet justice. Join the Sugar Squad and taste victory like never before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sugar Rush System \u2013 raise your sugar levels as you battle opponents and charge up your team to unleash massive damage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute hand-drawn kawaii art style with big eyes that hypnotize you with their cuteness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based combat pits you against pitted fruit and other monstrosities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laughs around every corner.\u00a0 Hilarious dialog throughout the story, and characters taunt each other during battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-class system with upgradable abilities to increase your team\u2019s effectiveness.\u00a0 Try different combinations to best suit your play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rest and recover your teammates, no perma-death!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore New York City via the procedural subway map for infinite replay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet all sorts of various critters.\u00a0 We mean rats.\u00a0 Lots of rats.\u00a0 Pizza rat, taco rat, etc.\u00a0 Subway is filled with them.\u00a0 And they help you on your quest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock various dance moves for your to use in your victory celebrations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect stickers, trinkets and snacks to help you in your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758490/extras/b8e6788a63e36696044b931a03da27a4.poster.avif?t=1748619576\" width=328 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758490/extras/b8e6788a63e36696044b931a03da27a4.webm?t=1748619576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Battle rival food factions in this hilarious tactical rogue-like RPG. Work your way through rounds of deliciously devious enemies to reach their final boss and fight your way to the top of the food chain! Do you have what it takes to be New York City\u2019s greatest food mascots?",
